      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Recent rainfall and leaking hydraulics create slippery patches that can throw off footing, traction, or drone stability.</p><p>Undergrid vagrants walk out into the street. <strong>Spend 1 Fear</strong> to force a <strong>Driving (12)</strong> check on one of the players.</p><p></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Critical Success</strong>: Tick down 2</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Success with Hope</strong>: Tick down 1</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Success with Fear</strong>: No Advancement</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Failure with Hope</strong>: Tick up 1</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-wid