    {
      "name": "Cut-off",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The party may <strong>Spend 1 Hope</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">each</span></strong></span> or the GM may <strong>Spend 2 Fear</strong> to trigger a constriction in the traffic against the opponent.</p><p></p><p>Depending no which side triggers this effect, the other side must as a <strong>Reaction</strong> make an immediate <strong>Driving</strong> check for the Difficulty of the environment.</p><p></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Critical Success</strong>: No Advancement</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Success</strong>: Tick up 1</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Failure</strong>: Tick up 2</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Critical Fail</strong>: You clip one of the cars in traffic, Tick up 3 and they got your license plate number</p></li></ul>",
